meta {
  name: 10 Go redirect (anonymous)
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

get {
  url: {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/go/{{publicCode}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  **The only anonymous showcase route.** iOS user agents are `302`'d to the App Store, Android to Play, anything
  else gets a static chooser page with the two-step instruction ("install, then scan again inside the app").
  Answers **identically for known, unknown and malformed codes** and stores only an anonymous per-platform counter
  — no address, cookie, timestamp or visitor id. `no-store`, `no-referrer`, strict CSP. Only an `https` store URL
  is ever redirected to or linked. Per-IP rate limited when `Security:RateLimiting:Enabled`.
}
